title: mf repo calibrate-threshold
tags: [[CLI command]]
kind: reference
summary: Measure the mass-write thresholds of the selected repository's disk

Runs the daemon's calibration task and waits for it: each kind of write timed one
record at a time and in bulk on a throwaway store, the threshold each gets, and the
times measured; `--write` sets them in the repository's `config.json`
([[Calibrating the mass-write thresholds]]). Stopped like any task
([[Cancelling a task]]), it leaves nothing behind.
